@@ -3030,8 +3030,11 @@
 
 First-touch onboarding hints and the structured profile-build offer:
 
+Set `onboarding.enabled: false` to disable gateway first-contact introductions, home-channel setup prompts, and first-time busy-input/tool-progress tips. Normal task results, clarification and permission requests still work.
+
 ```yaml
 onboarding:
+  enabled: true         # false disables gateway introductions and first-time tips
   profile_build: "ask"   # "ask" (default) | "off"
   seen: {}               # internal latch — leave empty
 ```
